summary:
The biggest advancement in AI since the invention of the transformer.
@huggingface is all you need.
Quoting @victormustar
@xenovacom @huggingface 💪

Word-level timestamps now available on Transformers, I've updated an old demo project for word-level video trimming, using the @gradio HighlightedText component as input. It's fun for short videos.
try it now:
🎬 https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1672401318001152002/pu/img/A7TWReafKd4u0FaW.jpg | https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/1672401318001152002/pu/vid/326x270/_ArfeFnWlvG01VeG.mp4?tag=12

In-browser TTS in 3 lines of code! 🤯
import { pipeline } from '@​xenova/transformers';
let pipe = await pipeline(
'text-to-speech', 'Xenova/speecht5_tts',
{ quantized: false }
);
let out = await pipe('Text goes here', {
speaker_embeddings: 'speaker_embeddings.bin'
});
🎬 https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1716708162655461376/pu/img/aT50TUlnsSTzF0mx.jpg | https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/1716708162655461376/pu/vid/avc1/480x270/lbUFARyy2yaFu-Bz.mp4?tag=12
Quoting @xenovacom
We just released 🤗 Transformers.js v2.7.0, which adds supports for 🗣️ Text to Speech w/ speecht5. This means you can now synthesize human speech directly in your browser... no server required! 🔥
Check out the demo! 👇
🎬 https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1716485610641186816/pu/img/LgmudlO6hTbD0Dn1.jpg | https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/1716485610641186816/pu/vid/avc1/320x320/5L2DfT0WOVoCMFvP.mp4?tag=12

How to perform image segmentation in 3 lines of JavaScript code:
import { pipeline } from '@​xenova/transformers';
const segmenter = await pipeline(
'image-segmentation',
'Xenova/face-parsing',
);
const output = await segmenter('image.jpg');
🎬 https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/GCY5s9tXYAEqL7n.jpg | https://video.twimg.com/tweet_video/GCY5s9tXYAEqL7n.mp4

@mixedbreadai just released 3 new state-of-the-art text reranker models, and now they're compatible with 🤗 Transformers.js! This means you can run them directly in your browser (and even Node.js)! 🤯
🔗 Demo:
🎬 https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1763607314907516928/pu/img/gW_L79Kv1kYYjgQN.jpg | https://video.twimg.com/ext_tw_video/1763607314907516928/pu/vid/avc1/392x270/OggB8xvv2hDaUIia.mp4?tag=12

You can run Gemma 4 100% locally in your browser thanks to HF transformers.js. That means 100% private and 100% free!
@xenovacom created a demo for it here:
📷 https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HE7DcpDXQAAt9lG.jpg

clean_summary:
Transformers.js and Reachy Mini were featured on stage at Google I/O 2026. Thanks to @IanBallantyne and the @GoogleDeepMind team for the shout-out.

@xenovacom: "I think Reachy is the one who needs chess lessons."

Robotics meets WebAI: Gemma 4 runs fully offline on WebGPU with Transformers.js, controlling Reachy Mini over WebSerial. No internet, just a browser and a USB-C cable. What should Reachy play next?

